#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:5
msgid "class WLAN -- control built-in WiFi interfaces"
msgstr "class WLAN -- controlo das interfaces WiFi integradas"

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`WLAN` class drives the on-board WiFi radios on modern OpenMV "
"Cams. The same class wraps two different underlying drivers depending on the"
" board's WiFi MCU:"
msgstr ""
"A classe :class:`WLAN` controla os rádios WiFi incorporados nas câmaras "
"OpenMV modernas. A mesma classe encapsula dois controladores subjacentes "
"distintos, dependendo do MCU WiFi da placa:"

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:11
msgid ""
"**CYW43** (Infineon CYW43xxx Murata WiFi module). Used by the OpenMV Cam N6,"
" OpenMV Cam RT1062, Arduino Portenta H7, Arduino Nicla Vision and Arduino "
"Giga R1 WiFi."
msgstr ""
"**CYW43** (módulo WiFi Infineon CYW43xxx Murata). Utilizado pelo OpenMV Cam "
"N6, OpenMV Cam RT1062, Arduino Portenta H7, Arduino Nicla Vision e Arduino "
"Giga R1 WiFi."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:14
msgid ""
"**NINA W10** (u-blox NINA-W10 / ESP32-WROOM). Used by the Arduino Nano "
"RP2040 Connect."
msgstr ""
"**NINA W10** (u-blox NINA-W10 / ESP32-WROOM). Utilizado pelo Arduino Nano "
"RP2040 Connect."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:17
msgid ""
"The two drivers expose the same method names but differ in a few arguments "
"and the set of accepted :meth:`config` keys. Differences are flagged below."
msgstr ""
"Os dois controladores expõem os mesmos nomes de métodos, mas diferem em "
"alguns argumentos e no conjunto de chaves :meth:`config` aceites. As "
"diferenças são assinaladas abaixo."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:21
msgid ""
"The OpenMV cameras with a legacy WINC1500 WiFi shield (M4 / M7 / H7 / H7 "
"Plus / Pure Thermal) use :class:`WINC` instead."
msgstr ""
"As câmaras OpenMV com o shield WiFi legado WINC1500 (M4 / M7 / H7 / H7 Plus "
"/ Pure Thermal) utilizam :class:`WINC` em alternativa."

